From: soup <s0up4200@pm.me>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:25:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Add automatic display brightness

Backport of omacom/omarchy pull request #8025 (s0up4200, "Add automatic
display brightness"), head 6c729990 ("Pause a built-in light sensor only
while the lid is closed"): omarchy brightness auto on|off|toggle|status,
the opt-in omarchy-brightness-auto user service that reads an IIO ambient
light sensor and drives the matching display through
omarchy-brightness-display (smoothed lux, log-shaped curve, threshold,
3-point ramp, a manual change becomes the new baseline), grouped Apple
display support, nonblocking writes in omarchy-brightness-display, and
the automatic-brightness toggle in the Display panel.

(backported from omacom/omarchy refs/pull/8025/head 6c729990: the net
diff cce8b1c9..6c729990 of the pull request's 11 files, applied to
v4.5.0 ac2690cd + J604 0001-0008 without conflicts. The branch's own
commits 4200bbbd 4dac5026 b9e38132 c8442dc0 086c9b4d e912c9e0 c48a1475
e52c29ce f813ad6c 6c729990 sit on a master newer than v4.5 and merge it
once (c9b3a613), so one squashed backport replaces ten picks whose test
infrastructure hunks conflict with v4.5.)

